<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     ASSIGNMENT COMPASS · Phase 1 + critique round (2026-07-30)
     Two locations in, one honest answer out: projected monthly costs,
     real state tax bracket math (2025 tables), GSA per diem for the
     assignment county, a breakeven number, and an offer-vs-offer mode
     with a negotiation card to carry into the recruiter call.
     Engine: /assets/js/assignment-compass-engine.js (pure functions,
     Node-testable). Data: /assets/data/assignment-compass.json +
     /assets/data/derived/compass-counties.json (from the canonical
     county registry). Per diem rides /.netlify/functions/perdiem
     (CSP pins connect-src to self; the GSA key stays server-side)
     and falls back to the standard CONUS rate when offline.
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

