          <p class="ac-hint" style="margin-top:10px" id="acTileNote"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="ac-card hu-ticks">
          <h2 class="ac-card-head"><i data-lucide="target"></i>Breakeven</h2>
          <div class="ac-be"><span class="num" id="acBeNum">...</span><span class="per" id="acBePer"></span></div>
          <p class="ac-be-sub" id="acBeSub"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="ac-card">
          <h2 class="ac-card-head"><i data-lucide="table"></i>Monthly ledger</h2>
          <div class="ac-ledger-wrap">
            <table class="ac-ledger" id="acLedger"></table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ac-card ac-bars-card">
          <h2 class="ac-card-head"><i data-lucide="bar-chart-2"></i>Where the money moves</h2>
          <svg class="ac-bars" id="acBars" role="img" aria-label="Per-category monthly cost difference between locations; the ledger table above carries the same numbers"></svg>
          <p class="ac-hint">Bars to the right cost more at the assignment. The ledger above has the exact figures.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ac-card">
          <h2 class="ac-card-head"><i data-lucide="bed-double"></i>GSA per diem, assignment county<span class="ac-badge" id="acPdBadge" hidden></span></h2>
          <div class="ac-pd-grid hu-stats" id="acPdTiles"></div>
          <p class="ac-pd-note">Agencies build travel stipends against these federal caps. If a recruiter's housing stipend is far under the lodging line for the county, that is your negotiation room.</p>
          <div class="ac-cost-row" style="margin-top:10px; max-width:340px">
            <label for="acStipend">Stipend offered ($/week, optional)</label>
            <input class="ac-input" id="acStipend" inputmode="numeric" value="" aria-describedby="acPdSub">
          </div>
          <p class="ac-pd-sub" id="acPdSub"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="ac-card" id="acLicCard" hidden>
          <h2 class="ac-card-head"><i data-lucide="badge-check"></i>License logistics<span class="ac-badge" id="acLicBadge"></span></h2>
          <div id="acLicBody"></div>
          <p class="ac-hint" style="margin-top:10px">Fees and timelines are planning numbers. Verify with the state board before you sign anything.</p>
